DTSTART:20260901T210000Z
DTEND:20260901T230000Z
SUMMARY:Tuba Skinny at Rockport Music
LOCATION:37 Main St\, Rockport\, MA 01966
DESCRIPTION:New Orleans street-jazz collective formed in 2009 by French Qua
 rter buskers\, playing trad jazz\, ragtime\, string-band\, and 1920s-30s b
 lues repertoire. Self-releases via independent labels (own imprint\, Louis
 iana Music Factory distribution)\; toured internationally\, won the 2023 A
 rhoolie Foundation Award\, and built a large following through fan-recorde
 d YouTube videos. Tickets: https://tickets.rockportmusic.org/events
CATEGORIES:jazz
END:VEVENT
