LOCATION:Latvian Lutheran Church of Boston\, Brookline
DESCRIPTION:Sateka (Latvian for "confluence") is the ongoing solo-plus-shif
 ting-ensemble project of Riga-born\, Boston-based guitarist/composer Rihar
 ds Kolmanis\, blending slide guitar and blues phrasing with Latvian choral
  and folk traditions\, jazz improvisation\, and world/ambient textures. "S
 ateka/Confluence" billed the project under both its Latvian and English na
 mes for a Boston-area Latvian-community jazz calendar date. Tickets: https
 ://jazzboston.org/jazz-calendar?sateka-confluence&event_id=426634&fid=1
CATEGORIES:jazz
